OL,3,GNEWSACoroner in lake swimming warning
OL,4,Aafter boy drowns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has warned about the
OL,7,F"inherent dangers of swimming in open
OL,8,Fwater" following the death of a
OL,9,F15-year-old boy who drowned in a lake
OL,10,Fin Lincoln.
OL,12,FEmergency crews were called to reports
OL,13,Fof a boy getting into difficulty at
OL,14,FSwanholme Lakes nature reserve, which
OL,15,Fis part of Hartsholme Park, at about
OL,16,F14:30 BST on 24 May.
OL,18,FLincolnshire Police said a body found
OL,19,Flater that day after a search was
OL,20,Fidentified as Declan Sawyer, who lived
OL,21,Fin the city.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
