OL,3,GNEWSACoroner in lake swimming warning
OL,4,Aafter boy drowns
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcluding his death was a result of
OL,7,Fmisadventure, coroner Marianne Johnson
OL,8,Furged people to follow open water
OL,9,Fswimming advice.
